<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 34-1 IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 34-1 IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand, 22 runs</p>
<p>behind on first innings, were 34 for one in their second innings</p>
<p>on the second day of the three-day match against a Pakistan</p>
<p>Cricket Board (PCB) XI on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 171and 34-1, PCB XI 193 for seven</p>
<p>declared.</p>
</text>
